he GPS trace is policy-clean (37 fixes, 10-second interval, 0 gaps), so no POL-RD-07 corroboration is needed and no POL-RD-10 escalation trigger fires. The deciding facts are carried by artifacts at weight_multiplier 1.0 each (EV-GPS-02846, EV-TRIP-02846, EV-FARE-02846), so the finding is not discounted. The monetary effect of 0.60 is below the 8.00 execution threshold and executes automatically."
